   "text": "So stop paying hundreds in monthly subscription costs, but the next one is even better."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.4,
   "end": 19.72,
   "text": "Number 2."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.88,
   "end": 20.92,
   "text": "A free AI video generator."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 23.04,
   "text": "It has tools like Cling, Sore, cut, cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.36,
